// Consent

#require "Ontology.eflint".

// Consent fact
Fact consent Identified by data-subject * controller * purpose * data. 

// Consent Act (GPDR Art. 6(1)(a) + Art. 7)
Act give-consent
    Actor data-subject
    Recipient controller
    Related to purpose, data
    Creates consent()
    Holds when !consent().

// Wihtdraw consent (GDPR Art. 7(3))
Act withdraw-consent
    Actor data-subject
    Recipient controller
    Related to purpose, data
    Terminates consent()
    Holds when consent().